Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 04:40:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add Tool Result Relay so the learner sees the tool output
 exactly

The Agent sometimes shortened, reworded, or added notes to the Story
Generator Tool's output; prompt tuning could not prevent it because an
LLM writes the final reply.

- Add custom_components/tool_result_relay.py (Agent -> Relay -> Chat Output):
  replaces the Agent's reply with the last successful tool output, and
  passes the Agent's text through when no tool was called
- Add tests/test_tool_result_relay.py (written first)
- Update README, CHANGELOG, DEVELOPER-DIARY, IMPLEMENTATION-GUIDE, and the
  class and workflow diagrams
